Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: %empty
    2        | program function
    3        | COMMENT

    4 function: FUNC TOKEN_IDENTIFIER LEFTPAREN new_parameters RIGHTPAREN LEFTCURLY statements RIGHTCURLY
    5         | FUNC type TOKEN_IDENTIFIER LEFTPAREN new_parameters RIGHTPAREN LEFTCURLY statements RIGHTCURLY

    6 new_parameters: %empty
    7               | new_parameter

    8 new_parameter: type TOKEN_IDENTIFIER
    9              | type TOKEN_IDENTIFIER COMMA new_parameter

   10 parameters: %empty
   11           | parameter

   12 parameter: TOKEN_IDENTIFIER
   13          | TOKEN_IDENTIFIER COMMA parameter

   14 statements: %empty
   15           | statements statement

   16 statement: new_variable
   17          | function_call
   18          | print
   19          | RETURN TOKEN_IDENTIFIER SEMICOLON
   20          | TOKEN_IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expressions SEMICOLON
   21          | COMMENT
   22          | BREAK SEMICOLON

   23 new_variable: type TOKEN_IDENTIFIER SEMICOLON
   24             | type TOKEN_IDENTIFIER ASSIGN NUMBER SEMICOLON

   25 type: INT

   26 print: PRINT LEFTPAREN TOKEN_IDENTIFIER RIGHTPAREN SEMICOLON

   27 function_call: TOKEN_IDENTIFIER LEFTPAREN parameters SEMICOLON

   28 expressions: %empty
   29            | expressions expression

   30 expression: NUMBER
   31           | TOKEN_IDENTIFIER
   32           | expression PLUS expression
   33           | expression SUBTRACT expression
   34           | expression MULTIPLY expression
   35           | expression DIVIDE expression
   36           | expression MODULUS expression


